The following test file in Cassandra's
test/unit/org/apache/cassandra/cql3/validation/operations directory, which
this directory mirrors, was not translated, because it tests Cassandra's
internal implementation through Java APIs instead of testing CQL:

* AutoSnapshotTest.java: checks the snapshots taken automatically by DROP
  and TRUNCATE, by changing Cassandra's auto_snapshot configuration through
  its internal configuration API and inspecting the snapshots through
  Cassandra's internal snapshot objects.

Note also that Cassandra's CompactStorageSplit1Test.java and
CompactStorageSplit2Test.java were split from an older CompactStorageTest.java,
which was translated as compact_storage_test.py.
